WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.925
Alt text starts from the annotated frame's layers. Each numbered step is a layer named Step, number, and the label to read aloud.

00:08.905 --> 00:16.905
Draft alt reads the steps in order and writes the alt text, so the numbers in the text always match the numbers in the image.

00:16.885 --> 00:21.235
For the workstream selector, a subject sets how the sentence starts.

00:21.215 --> 00:30.190
Apply saves the draft through set alt, which runs the inventory's checks. Here it already matches the approved text, so nothing changes.
